       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QLLPC18.
      * PENAL CHARGE ON AMOUNT DUE AFTER DUE DATE
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DPD                    PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-OUTSTANDING-AFTER      PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-PENAL                  PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-DPD
           ACCEPT WS-OUTSTANDING-AFTER
           PERFORM 2000-PENAL
           DISPLAY 'PENAL: ' WS-PENAL
           STOP RUN.
       2000-PENAL.
      * DPD COUNTS FROM THE STATEMENT PAYMENT DUE DATE.
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-PENAL
           IF WS-DPD > 3
              COMPUTE WS-PENAL ROUNDED = WS-OUTSTANDING-AFTER * 0.02
           END-IF.
